  "title": "Baked Puffy Fish Tacos",
  "description": "Tender white fish is baked on tortillas for Chef John's puffy, crispy take on tacos served with zesty cabbage slaw, homemade sauce, and toppings in this easy recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-04-12T09:00:00-04:00",
